<title>JAPAN: Japan Nov rapeseed imports down 10.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Nov rapeseed imports down 10.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's rapeseed imports in November totalled 190,791 tonnes, down 10.4 percent from the same month a year earlier, according to Finance Ministry statistics released on Thursday.</p>
<p>The breakdown was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			Nov 96	 Oct 96	Nov 95</p>
<p> Total rapeseed   190,791	189,120     213,004</p>
<p>Major supplier of rapeseed (in tonnes):</p>
<p> Canada	     182,341	144,042     206,077</p>
<p>Imports in the first 11 months of 1996 were 1.8 million tonnes, versus 1.7 million tonnes in the same period of 1995.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7391</p>
</text>
